meta {
  name: Needs Meeting Link
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/appointments/needs-meeting-link
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ADMIN/SUPER_ADMIN only (VIEWER gets 403). Upcoming active portal bookings at a virtual location whose
  video-call link the provider still has to add (`meetingStatus: NEEDS_LINK`: Google not connected, the
  scheduler off, or Meet provisioning failed). Returns `{ count, appointments: [{ id, startAt }] }`
  (at most 50 listed). Adding a link with `PATCH /appointments/:id` (`meetingUrl`) makes it `READY`
  and emails the link to the patient.
}
